// TODO Branching Gateway UX is complicated with success cases - unneccessary outgoing branch. Maybe
// allow for an id-less arrow? `->` or `->"label"` That should then implicitly be the right-of case as well.
// TODO Joining Gateway UX is complicated with success cases - unneccessary additional incoming
// branch. Just allow implicit incoming branch if the lifeline is still active, as that one usually
// does not have any label.
